<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Know that many first, arrive last,</l><l>And many last become the first.</l><l>But you, what’s your standing?</l><l>Don’t let yourself go just halfway!</l><l>Go on! Move on! Yes, forward stretch!</l><l>All that makes us backward shrink, forget!</l><l>Run with endurance, till we arrive!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Time is now! Don’t wait another day!</l><l>Forget your past the Lord is calling you!</l><l>Once stumbled, and backslidden!</l><l>Once offended, hurt, and fallen!</l><l>But overcomers are those who still rise up!</l><l>Oh! Look at Christ’s attractive face!</l><l>Grace has been given, to run the race.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
